{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38934","headline":"题衡阳隐士山居 · 杜荀鹤","name":"题衡阳隐士山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲居不问世如何，云起山门日已斜。\n放鹤去寻三岛客，任人来看四时花。\n松醪腊酝安神酒，布水宵煎觅句茶。\n毕竟金多也头白，算来争得似君家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}